extraction_notes: "Rifts World Book 36: Sovietski printed 68-73 (cache p068-p073, cache page = printed folio + 0 for printed 38-177), a text layer; the stat block (printed 70-72) and the experience table (printed 224, cache p220) read off 110 dpi renders. Heading Wolverine People R.C.C. on printed 68; tag line Wolverine People - Optional Player Character or NPC on printed 70; the block ends on printed 73 above the Yaganar R.C.C. || XP: the race block says to use the Wilderness Scout table, but the Experience Tables (printed 224) print a column headed Cold Born and Wolverine People; that ladder is stored. || SEX: the book prints separate male and female attributes, M.D.C., P.P.E., bonuses and attack gains; the class states the male figures and a pick-one Sex group restates the female ones (attribute_dice, mdc_base, +1D6 P.P.E., +1 initiative, +1 Perception, attacks at 2 and 8). Level 16 lies past the 15-level table and is prose. || M.O.S.: the three Sovietski Military Training packages are skills.mos options carrying the skills; their M.O.S. Bonuses are a parallel pick-one Training group, because an M.O.S. option carries skills only. Outdoor-only Perception bonuses, the Reconnaissance +10% to Land Navigation, Prowl and Tracking, and the female-only Special Forces attack are prose. || WILD-BORN: the seven Wild Wolverine People R.C.C. Related Skills are occ_related_skills with count 0, raised to 7 by Background: Wild-born. The printed Espionage line gives +10% to Tracking only; no Espionage bonus is stored. Lore (any) is the Rifts Lore rows the catalog held on 2026-11-22. Physical excludes every Hand to Hand style beyond Basic the catalog held that day. || SECONDARY: one at levels 2, 4, 8 and 14 (Rifts Ultimate Edition list). || AVAILABLE O.C.C.s: none, as every O.C.C. group excluded. || POOLS: no Hit Points or S.D.C.; M.D.C. as printed. Natural A.R. 15 applies in S.D.C. settings only. || EQUIPMENT: the generic Sovietski kit the catalog holds is equipment_starting; weapons of the book''s own (brass knuckles at 1D4 M.D., wooden punching daggers), the wild-born kit and pay are restrictions prose. No starting_money: the 200 credits is monthly pay and the 4D6x100 is trade goods. || NOT STORED: Experience Level 1D4 for NPCs; nicknames, size, weight, life span 4D6+50, habitat, slave value, allies and enemies are in GM Notes and on the wolverine-people creatures row."
